      "mergeID": "63d5b30e1c0e3f4e19332fc7",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I've noticed that there is only an option to notify no one or everyone within a group. It'd be nice to be able to make targeted announcements for anyone with a role. This way let's say that you have a group about mini-game world meetups. This way people could only get notified for what their role says they'd be interested in. Or for others who get roles to their patron supporters, this could be a way to let those people keep up to date as well.\n\nGotta add, I'm really excited for what groups will add to VRchat as a whole.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Creating Group-Announcements Using Roles",
